435
00:24:23.479 --> 00:24:27.042
Idempotency keys moved to a Raft-backed store with CAS.

436
00:24:28.392 --> 00:24:40.296
Related ADRs, ADR-400 Storage: leveled compaction for carts, TWCS for sessions, Bloom FP 1%, alerts at 50% disk (L1).

437
00:24:40.576 --> 00:24:50.923
ADR-401 Durability: carts commitlogsync=group, sessions periodic 10 s; both RF=3 across 3 AZs (L2).

438
00:24:51.203 --> 00:24:59.309
ADR-402 Repair: incremental nightly, full weekly per range, throttled; replacement streams off-peak (L3).

439
00:24:59.589 --> 00:25:12.368
ADR-403 Consistency: carts QUORUM or QUORUM with speculative retry at p99; sessions ONE or ONE; idempotency keys in etcd-like Raft store (L4).

